---
layout: layouts/world.njk
title: Public Orientation and Literacy
description: Hii develops plain-language relational AI literacy so people can stay oriented, discerning, and grounded while living alongside AI systems.
permalink: /understand/index.html
---
{% set world = worlds.understand %}
{% set artifact = library.artifacts.epistemicGuardrails %}

<section class="world-hero section-shell">
  <div class="world-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ world.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>{{ world.title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ world.introduction }}</p>
  </div>
  <blockquote>{{ world.question }}</blockquote>
</section>

<section class="section-shell orientation-section" aria-labelledby="orientation-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
    <h2 id="orientation-heading">Four things to notice before reaching a conclusion.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="orientation-grid">
    {% for item in world.orientation %}
      <article class="orientation-card">
        <p class="pathway-number" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</p>
        <p class="orientation-label">{{ item.label }}</p>
        <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.text }}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell questions-section" aria-labelledby="questions-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Common questions</p>
    <h2 id="questions-heading">Orientation begins by separating questions that are often collapsed.</h2>
  </div>
  {% set disclosureItems = world.questions %}
  {% include "components/disclosure-list.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section-shell evidence-literacy-section" aria-labelledby="evidence-literacy-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Evidence and confidence</p>
    <h2 id="evidence-literacy-heading">Every public claim should show what kind of claim it is.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="evidence-key">
    {% for label in evidence.labels %}
      <article>
        <p class="evidence-name">{{ label.name }}</p>
        <p>{{ label.description }}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="shared-artifact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Shared research standard</p>
    <h2>Keep interpretation answerable to evidence.</h2>
  </div>
  {% include "components/artifact-card.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section-shell pathway-section understand-pathway-section" aria-labelledby="understand-pathway-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Choose my pathway</p>
    <h2 id="understand-pathway-heading">Continue from the role you hold.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="pathway-grid public-pathway-grid">
    {% for pathway in world.pathways %}
      <article class="pathway-card">
        <p class="pathway-number" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3>{{ pathway.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ pathway.text }}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ pathway.href }}">Follow this pathway <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="film-orientation-section">
  <div class="section-shell film-orientation-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Hii Film</p>
      <h2>The institute remains at the center.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>The approved Hii Film remains in the center circle of the front door. Return to the settled observatory and select Hii Film.</p>
      <a class="button-link" href="/?return=hii">Return to Hii</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="boundary-section">
  <div class="section-shell boundary-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Public boundary</p>
    <h2>Public literacy should reduce both panic and false reassurance.</h2>
    <p>Hii does not ask people to trust AI systems, reject them, or accept one story about what they mean. The aim is to improve the quality of attention, judgment, language, and collective decision-making.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell closing-section" aria-labelledby="understand-closing-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Continue</p>
  <h2 id="understand-closing-heading">Follow the question into relationship-level study.</h2>
  <div class="closing-actions">
    <a class="button-link" href="/relationships/">Explore Relationships</a>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ artifact.href }}">Review Epistemic Guardrails <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
